      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H40310",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-08",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The Chair announced the unfinished business to be the consideration of the veto. (consideration: CR H212)",
        "type": "President"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-08",
        "actionTime": "13:53:27",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on the veto message of the President to H.R. 131, the Chair put the question on will the House, on reconsideration, pass the bill, the objections of the President to the contrary notwithstanding. Under the Constitution, the vote must be taken by the yeas and nays. Further proceedings were postponed until a time to be announced.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H35000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-08",
        "actionTime": "13:53:06",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The previous question was ordered without objection.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-08",
        "actionTime": "13:28:07",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to a previous order of the House of January 2, 2026, the unfinished business is the further consideration of the veto message of the President on H.R. 131. The House proceeded with one hour of debate on the objections of the President to the contrary notwithstanding. (consideration: CR H205-208)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H40300",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-08",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The Chair laid before the House the veto message from the President.",
        "type": "Veto"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-02",
        "actionTime": "16:07:01",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "POSTPONED CONSIDERATION OF VETO MESSAGE - The Chair announced that further consideration of the veto message and the bill, H.R. 131, is postponed until the legislative day of January 8, 2026. Agreed to without objection.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-02",
        "actionTime": "16:07:00",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The Chair announced that the objections of the President to H.R. 131 would be spread at large upon the Journal and the veto message would be printed as a House Document (119-119).",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "actionCode": "H8D000",
        "actionDate": "2026-01-02",
        "actionTime": "16:03:09",
        "sourceSystem": {
          "code": 2,
          "name": "House floor actions"
        },
        "text": "The Chair laid before the House the veto message from the President.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
